  "keyFeatures": [
    "Modular application framework (AbpModule, dependency lifecycle)",
    "Volo.Abp.Core kernel (AbpApplicationBase, module loading, options, virtual file system)",
    "Autofac DI integration",
    "Domain-Driven Design building blocks (Entity, AggregateRoot, Repository, DomainService, ValueObject, Specification)",
    "Application Services and DTOs (Volo.Abp.Ddd.Application*)",
    "Unit of Work (Volo.Abp.Uow) with ambient UoW & transaction management",
    "Data layer (Volo.Abp.Data) with extra-properties, object extensions, GUID generators",
    "Object mapping (Volo.Abp.ObjectMapping + AutoMapper integration)",
    "Auditing (Volo.Abp.Auditing/Contracts) with audit log saving and entity history",
    "Authorization (Volo.Abp.Authorization*) with permissions/policies/grants",
    "Features (Volo.Abp.Features) and GlobalFeatures (Volo.Abp.GlobalFeatures)",
    "Settings (Volo.Abp.Settings)",
    "Validation (Volo.Abp.Validation + FluentValidation integration)",
    "Exception handling (Volo.Abp.ExceptionHandling)",
    "Localization (Volo.Abp.Localization)",
    "Multi-tenancy (Volo.Abp.MultiTenancy + AspNetCore.MultiTenancy)",
    "Multi-lingual objects (Volo.Abp.MultiLingualObjects)",
    "Event Bus: local, distributed, inbox/outbox, RabbitMQ, Kafka, Azure, Rebus, Dapr",
    "Background Jobs and Background Workers (default, Hangfire, Quartz, RabbitMQ-based)",
    "Caching (Volo.Abp.Caching + StackExchange.Redis)",
    "Distributed Locking (Volo.Abp.DistributedLocking + Dapr variant)",
    "EF Core providers (SqlServer, PostgreSql, MySQL, Sqlite, Oracle, Oracle.Devart)",
    "MongoDB persistence provider",
    "Dapper integration and in-memory DB provider",
    "ASP.NET Core MVC, Razor, Bundling, Bootstrap, Theme Shared, Widgets",
    "Blazor (Server, WebAssembly, MAUI Blazor) with Theming, BlazoriseUI",
    "SignalR integration",
    "Serilog integration",
    "OpenAPI / Swashbuckle integration",
    "API Versioning Abstractions",
    "Remote Services & HTTP client dynamic proxies (Web, Dapr, IdentityModel variants)",
    "Authentication: JwtBearer, OAuth, OpenIdConnect, IdentityModel, LDAP",
    "Emailing (Volo.Abp.Emailing + MailKit)",
    "SMS (Volo.Abp.Sms + Aliyun)",
    "BLOB storing: Filesystem, Azure, AWS, Aliyun, Minio, Database (module)",
    "Imaging abstractions with ImageSharp and Magick.NET implementations",
    "Text templating (Razor & Scriban)",
    "Virtual File System and Embedded Resources",
    "Dapr building blocks (event bus, distributed locking, HTTP client, MVC)",
    "ABP CLI (Volo.Abp.Cli / Cli.Core) commands: new, add-module, add-package, build, bundle, generate-proxy, install-libs, login, prompt, switch-to-*",
    "Service Proxying (Angular, CSharp, JavaScript) for client code generation",
    "Identity module (users, roles, organizations, claims, security logs)",
    "Account module (login, register, profile, IdentityServer/OpenIddict variants)",
